      "message": "For consistency, should not we apply the same fix here?\n\nA 10% task, which is 50% boosted, will gets a 450 utilization margin, which potentially completely eclipse the fix on fidn_new_capacity. \n\nIndeed, if it\u0027s the only task on a CPU, this 100+450\u003d550 utilization is the value used by schedutil to select the OPP. Thus, again we should consider the capacity_margin to potentially skip the min_capacity OPP.",
